{
  "slug": "scalekit-modular-scim",
  "name": "Scalekit Modular Scim",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automate user provisioning and deprovisioning. Sync users, roles, and groups from Okta, Azure AD, or any SCIM-compatible directory into your app automatically.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **1 agent**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `implementing-admin-portal` (Implements Scalekit's admin portal for customer self-serve SSO and SCIM configuration), `modular-scim` (Implements SCIM user provisioning using Scalekit's Directory API and webhooks), `production-readiness-scalekit` (Walks through a structured production readiness checklist for Scalekit SCIM provisioning implementations)\n- **Agents** (1): `setup-scalekit` (Sets up Scalekit env vars, installs/initializes the SDK, and verifies credentials by listing organizations)\n- **Hooks** (1): `Stop`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `scalekit`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install scalekit-modular-scim@claude-community` from `scalekit-inc/claude-code-authstack` (`plugins/modular-scim`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
